'''Lazing About''' (なまけ者たち, ''Namakemono Tachi'', '''Lazy People''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] and is unlocked after reaching [[User Rank]] 2700.

==Effect==
"Strong" Effect UP (Sm): The effect of this ability is increased by 10%.

